"screenshot_1.png", "id": "29736817785918153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_29736817795918152_5888086009037111158_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xl0Aom2eL2IQ7kNvwEU_Rs6&_nc_oc=Ado82dkc4DzNdzN9Rh1b6DsqyqX8YoVjNXgDTqqT4--9WhvjOYS8K_RTL3JSri-xvA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTR8SO6rK-uod3vyeRj2OI95mB1g0dckel7xKUve0UTYQ&oe=6AF48448"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2.png", "id": "2021536735229737", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_2021536738563070_3903864663498447755_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nJN-JxuKW5YQ7kNvwGqUgLV&_nc_oc=AdqjRuzYBcS4CK0hco73nV-7nxdObdprJkha-fydjlSfGWDi-Q6zMJ9fxggIYtxj72o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSyhop23cWlvAcYoHw8g6QvvIsrV0RcEGB5iE_Vd3s2iQ&oe=6AF47968"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_4.png", "id": "1580446287458147", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_1580446290791480_8096072921101344890_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4K0GT8_43boQ7kNvwFUgjEg&_nc_oc=AdqFt7KiFIhElv35sB0vbTm74ek7_-YI5amymr4jnkilVYYnqCb2LRIcC_dTGiBrsRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8XjIN25yNthZD5Lc0o-S30CCyXSp-4nUWrDI7B5UVkw&oe=6AF48E90"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "2577097822797164", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_2577097826130497_1752737504800637924_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O8efLzyC7sUQ7kNvwFVxnqq&_nc_oc=AdojTYR_eubSRTqa3YE1pxJm6Dc5G-F8ciQZdLkbSWbVtSiTs5gs4J9mKDQYy6M_V-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRkUcoi_1--SSd5489xATWzYbtgpqpjriyeGY0osbZJAQ&oe=6AF48289"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "1434601438797406", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_1434601442130739_2266866342583006158_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMa56scJ-kIQ7kNvwE9IPqy&_nc_oc=AdoVZyf9UxvxRNzgckoCqYslVg4M5ORFJZR7Xjk-XWUvSvwthnzpkWPJCTJMBqXD99Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMtFDLKZZYf3Z2BEFnVBOfNZ-E4igAWoQt_ajIqNzDgw&oe=6AF48CF8"}, "display_name": "Flight Simulator VR", "keywords": ["flight", "simulator", "airplane", "fighter", "helicopter"], "long_description": "Flight Simulator VR puts you in the pilot's seat over a whole island.\n\nA WHOLE ISLAND\nForty kilometres of coast, city, farmland, forest and mountains. Seven airports to land at: an international hub with two long runways, a city airport on its own island beside the downtown towers, an alpine strip in a high mountain basin, a fjord strip between rock walls, a clifftop field, a farmland airfield and a short strip on an offshore island.\n\nFOUR AIRCRAFT\nA private jet, a twin-engine supersonic fighter, a four-seat light plane and a helicopter. Each has its own cockpit and its own way of flying.\n\nA GLASS COCKPIT\nLive flight displays, a moving map and an autopilot. Grab the yoke, the side-stick or the thrust levers with your hands, or fly with the thumbsticks. Stand up and walk through the private jet's cabin.\n\nYOUR OWN HANGAR\nWalk around your aircraft, repaint them and power wash them clean, then choose one and fly.\n\nMISSIONS AND FREE FLIGHT\nLanding challenges, a ring course up a mountain gorge, a harbour run between the bridge pylons, a night landing and an island tour - or just fly, by day, at sunset or at night.\n\nFLY TOGETHER ONLINE\nQuick Match or a private sky with a 4-digit code. Join up on a friend's wing or ride in their aircraft. Voice chat stays off until you turn it on.", "short_description": "Take the left seat of a private jet, a twin-engine fighter, a light plane and a helicopter, and fly a whole island: seven airports, a city on a harbour, snow peaks, a fjord and a tropical sea. Paint and wash your aircraft in your own hangar. Fly solo or together online."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatorvr/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatorvr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1362997603559769"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2107305629884238"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2107305629884238"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791388560, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2107305629884238"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1376158335577029", "version": "1.0.2"}, "id": "1808723053566619", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1362997580226438", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1376158335577029"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1808723053566619"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.2 - stable cockpit at any altitude, seated fighter stick, fighter canopy c